    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Viewing by APPOINTMENT ONLY - email Rachel on sales@lynam.ie or TXT on 087 9496889**\r\n\r\nWelcome to 1A Larchfield Road, Goatstown - a very fine, mature, detached property of approx. 138 sqm set on a sun-drenched site in a prime residential area. Available exclusively through Lynam Auctioneers, this delightful residence offers an exceptional opportunity for comfortable living and is perfectly positioned just a short stroll from a host of South Dublin's finest amenities.\r\n\r\nA blend of traditional and contemporary Design,  No. 1A Larchfield is a testament to thoughtful decoration. This gem has been exquisitely updated and combines lots of space with modern and comfortable living.\r\n\r\nThis property was built in 2003 and has been extensively refurbished by the current owners to create a highly energy efficient B rated home. An elegant gravel driveway leads from the gated entrance to this property, and offers exceptionally large space for off street parking. \r\n\r\nTo the rear is a manicured and private back garden with 2 patio areas, one at the end of the garden to allow for maximum sun exposure, an ideal spot for al fresco dining and entertaining. \r\n\r\nThe ground floor accommodation comprises a spacious and welcoming entrance hallway with timber flooring, a formal living room and a guest bathroom. Elegant touches can be found throughout from the dark herringbone flooring in the living room to the feature wallpaper in the guest WC. The open plan kitchen is filled with natural light from the sliding doors to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen itself features sleek cabinetry, built-in appliances and a kitchen peninsula. Off the kitchen is an additional room, ideal for use as a playroom, den or office space.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor, there are 4 well appointed and spacious bedrooms. The master bedroom boasts chic built in wardrobes, carpeted floors and a separate en suite bathroom. Accommodation is completed by a modern family bathroom with a bath.  \r\n\r\nThis property offers the discerning purchaser a fantastic opportunity to live in a fabulous home, put down roots, and start creating lifelong memories.  We recommend viewing as early as possible."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall: c. 3.66m x 2.71m max\r\n\r\nWC: c. 1.70m x 1.45m\r\n\r\nLiving room: c 3.81m x 5.17m\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room: c. 5.53m x 4.04m \r\n\r\nPlayroom/den: c. 2.76m x 3.95m\r\n\r\nLanding: c. 3.09m x 4.64m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: c. 3.69m x 4.04m max\r\n\r\nEn suite:c. 0.90m x 2.62m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: c. 4.65m x 3.35m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: c. 3.39m x 2.45m\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: c. 2.76m x 3.95m\r\n\r\nBathroom: c. 1.73m x 2.82m\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Whilst every attempt has been made to ensure the accuracy of the floor plan contained here, measurements of doors, windows, rooms and any other item are approximate and no responsibility is taken for any error, omission, or misstatement. This plan is for illustrative purposes only and should only be used as such by any prospective purchaser."
